 r←Test_Busy_001(stopFlag batchFlag);n;i;⎕TRAP;noOfThreads
⍝ Exercise the simplest possible case with `Busy`.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 noOfThreads←⍴⎕TNUMS

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Busy.Create'This may take a moment...'

 :For i :In 2+⍳9
     ⎕DL 0.2
     n #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Busy.SetPercent 10×i
 :EndFor
 n.∆CloseForm
 →T.FailsIf noOfThreads≠⍴⎕TNUMS

 r←T._OK
